  "note": "The NDM combined instantiation of CCSDS 505.0-B-3 clause 4.11: one XML file carrying several navigation messages under an \u003cndm\u003e root. What these vectors assert is the structure that wrapping adds — how many messages a file holds, of what types, in what order, and which master schema the root names. The constituents themselves are asserted by the vectors of pkg/odm, pkg/adm, pkg/tdm and pkg/cdm, because a message inside a combined file is the same message and is read by the same decoder. One vector is published text, from figure G-21 of CCSDS 502.0-B-3; the other is derived, because no figure in either standard prints a file that mixes them and clause 4.11.7 allows one.",
